Value SLOT (\d+)
Value SENSOR (\S+)
Value SENSOR_ID (\d+)
Value TEMPERATURE (\S+)
Value LOWER (\S+)
Value WARNING (\S+)
Value ALARM (\S+)
Value SHUTDOWN (\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${SLOT}\s+${SENSOR}\s+${SENSOR_ID}\s+${TEMPERATURE}\s+${LOWER}\s+${WARNING}\s+${ALARM}\s+${SHUTDOWN}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*Slot\s+Sensor\s+Temperature
  ^\s*System\s+temperature\s+information
  ^\s*-+
